      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Right after being born, each Flabébé searches for\na flower it likes, then it cares for that flower for<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe rest of its life!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
